.if \n[.g] .mso www.tmac
.TH SDL_AppIterate_func 3type "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 DATATYPES"
.SH NAME
SDL_AppIterate_func \- Function pointer typedef for
.BR SDL_AppIterate .

.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_init.h>
.PP
.BI "typedef SDL_AppResult (SDLCALL *SDL_AppIterate_func)(void *appstate);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
These are used by
.BR SDL_EnterAppMainCallbacks \[char46]
This mechanism operates behind the scenes for apps using the optional main callbacks\[char46] Apps that want to use this should just implement
.BR SDL_AppIterate
directly\[char46]

.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I appstate
an optional pointer, provided by the app in
.BR SDL_AppInit \[char46]

.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns
.BR SDL_APP_FAILURE
to terminate with an error,
.BR SDL_APP_SUCCESS
to terminate with success,
.BR SDL_APP_CONTINUE
to continue\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This datatype is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

